      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/original/3X/4/9/4925a20f8fbb8b1035afd6c80216a898ea72eb23.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/ar5tZEqmxj1xnSXX14hT9waQxAD.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"1000104187\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/4/9/4925a20f8fbb8b1035afd6c80216a898ea72eb23_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"1000104187\" data-base62-sha1=\"ar5tZEqmxj1xnSXX14hT9waQxAD\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/4/9/4925a20f8fbb8b1035afd6c80216a898ea72eb23_2_690x388.jpeg, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/4/9/4925a20f8fbb8b1035afd6c80216a898ea72eb23_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/uploads/iitm/optimized/3X/4/9/4925a20f8fbb8b1035afd6c80216a898ea72eb23_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"594446\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">1000104187</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 217 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The first line is always getting this error<br>\nMay I know how to correctly type the script such that i don’t get this error and it will get evaluated successfully.<br>\nwhich helps me for the OPPE.<br>\nThank you</p>",
