      "created_at": "2025-03-26T12:38:32.605Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You have to write a <code>sed</code> script, not a <code>bash</code> script. It should not have <code>sed</code> command or any flags, it is directly the <code>sed</code> script.</p>\n<p>For example:</p>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"bash\"><code class=\"lang-bash\">sed 's/apple/banana/g' data.csv\n</code></pre>\n<p>is a bash script.</p>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"sed\"><code class=\"lang-sed\">s/apple/banana/g\n</code></pre>\n<p>is a sed script.</p>",
